' Aus test_comprehensions.py uebertragen (24 Faelle, aufgezeichnet 2026-09-07). Format: docs/werkzeuge.md, dhrt test.

=== comp basic tuple source (1)
DIM nums AS TUPLE
nums = (1, 2, 3, 4, 5)
DIM doubled AS TUPLE
doubled = [n * 2 FOR n IN nums]
PRINT doubled
--- erwartet
(2, 4, 6, 8, 10)

=== comp basic tuple source (2)
