=== comp with filter (1)
DIM nums AS TUPLE
nums = (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6)
DIM evens AS TUPLE
evens = [n FOR n IN nums WHERE n MOD 2 = 0]
PRINT evens
--- erwartet
(2, 4, 6)

=== comp with filter (2)
